INSERT INTO public."TestsData" ("TestId", "Questions", "Options", "Answers") VALUES (4600093826010125, ARRAY['"[8 marks] Explain and apply The general design procedure in “Basic Considerations in Process Equipment Design”; include the principle, an example and a verification or limitation."'::jsonb, '"[8 marks] Explain and apply Material selection in “Design Consideration”; include the principle, an example and a verification or limitation."'::jsonb, '"[8 marks] Explain and apply Operating conditions in “Pressure Vessels”; include the principle, an example and a verification or limitation."'::jsonb, '"[8 marks] Explain and apply Material of construction in “Reaction Vessels”; include the principle, an example and a verification or limitation."'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY[]::jsonb[], ARRAY['"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning (2):** The general design procedure appears in “Basic Considerations in Process Equipment Design”. Define its purpose, explain the key steps or factors, connect it to Fabrication Techniques, Equipment classification, Power for rotational motion, Basic Considerations in Process Equipment Design, and give an applied example plus a check or limitation.\n\n**Principles/steps (3):** Explain the topic and relate it to Fabrication Techniques, Equipment classification, Power for rotational motion, Basic Considerations in Process Equipment Design.\n\n**Application/example (2):** Apply it to a practical CHEMICAL PROCESS EQUIPMENT DESIGN problem and state the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1):** Check the result and state a limitation or risk.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles 3; application 2; verification 1."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning (2):** Material selection appears in “Design Consideration”. Define its purpose, explain the key steps or factors, connect it to Corrosion prevention, Stresses created due to static and dynamic loads, Combined stresses and theories of failure, Fatigue, and give an applied example plu